        "pageBreakBefore": false,
        "tableDepth": 0,
        "sectionIndex": 0
      },
      "inTableOfContents": false
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "body[1]/p[13]",
      "sourceOrdinal": 12,
      "rawText": "Operating Context. The Governing Committee welcomed the overview from the Ukrainian GC Member on the importance of the F.O.R.T.I.S. FIF as a stable and predictable source of financing to help meet the needs for the 2026 budget, which assumes another full year of war; the Government\u2019s priority to broaden the revenue base; its commitment to strengthen investment climate, public financial management; and public investment management. The GC member also welcomed the February 26 approval by the IMF of a new 48-month extended arrangement under the Extended Fund Facility (EFF) as part of a broader international financial package, including the macro-financial assistance from the European Union.",
      "fullSpan": {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 696
      },
      "style": {
        "styleId": "Normal",
        "styleName": "Normal",
        "builtInHeadingStyleLevel": null,
        "outlineLevel": null,
        "bold": false,
        "italic": false,
        "underline": false,
        "allCaps": false,
        "fontSizePt": 12,
        "alignment": "both"
      },
      "numbering": {
        "numberingId": null,
        "numberingLevel": null,
        "numberLabel": null,
        "numberingFormat": null,
        "numberingStyleHeadingLevel": null
      },
      "layout": {
        "inContentControl": false,
        "keepNext": false,
        "pageBreakBefore": false,
        "tableDepth": 0,
        "sectionIndex": 0
      },
      "inTableOfContents": false
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "body[1]/p[14]",
      "sourceOrdinal": 13,
      "rawText": "Funding Request for Eighth Additional Financing to Public Expenditures for Administrative Capacity Endurance (PEACE) in Ukraine Investment Project Financing. The Governing Committee approved by consensus, with the affirmative votes by Canada and Japan, the use of $1.258 billion in F.O.R.T.I.S. Ukraine FIF resources to support the 8th additional financing to the PEACE project. Under this operation, FIF resources will be used to pay government and education sector wages; health care expenses included under the Program for Medical Guarantees; first responders\u2019 wages; and social assistance benefits, and for the reimbursement of central government subsidies for monthly pensions payments. The United States recorded a non-blocking abstention",
      "fullSpan": {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 744
      },
      "style": {
        "styleId": "Normal",
        "styleName": "Normal",
        "builtInHeadingStyleLevel": null,
