    {
      "sourceId": "body[1]/p[20]",
      "sourceOrdinal": 20,
      "rawText": "Next Bi-Annual Meeting of the GC. The Governing Committee agreed with the Chair\u2019s proposal, consistent with the FIF Governance Framework, that no formal GC meeting will be scheduled for the remainder of 2026 given the resource availability after the funding decision above; and that a meeting could be convened at any time during the year in coordination with the Chair and members upon request of a GC member or for any developments that warrant such a meeting. Until such time, all other FIF business can be facilitated by the FIF Secretariat electronically.",
      "fullSpan": {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 560
      },
